  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f\" style=\"margin: 30px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size:12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(119, 119, 119);\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\" style=\"margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostList.nhn?blogId=obafgkim&amp;from=postList&amp;categoryNo=21#\" class=\"se-module se-module-image __se_image_link __se_link\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot; : &quot;SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f&quot;, &quot;src&quot; : &quot;https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAxOTA4MjlfNyAg/MDAxNTY3MDQ1MjEzODc3.4h7yhKSFud9Z2hatXrkmhr7lsK4a0KrdS3__gN1s8RIg.1gEdIS10_1z6FOckilg20GlS9HHFC04JAJBI5Jv4Y3Ag.JPEG.obafgkim/슬라이드1.JPG&quot;, &quot;linkUse&quot; : &quot;false&quot;, &quot;link&quot; : &quot;&quot;}\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: block;\"></a><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostList.nhn?blogId=obafgkim&amp;from=postList&amp;categoryNo=21#\" class=\"se-module se-module-image __se_image_link __se_link\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot; : &quot;SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f&quot;, &quot;src&quot; : &quot;https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAxOTA4MjlfNyAg/MDAxNTY3MDQ1MjEzODc3.4h7yhKSFud9Z2hatXrkmhr7lsK4a0KrdS3__gN1s8RIg.1gEdIS10_1z6FOckilg20GlS9HHFC04JAJBI5Jv4Y3Ag.JPEG.obafgkim/슬라이드1.JPG&quot;, &quot;linkUse&quot; : &quot;false&quot;, &quot;link&quot; : &quot;&quot;}\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: block;\"><p>수업 전체를 올리기 보다는 선생님들이 가져다 쓰시기 좋게 자료만 따로 올립니다!</p><p><br></p><p>답안이 표시되지 않은 학습지 자료와 전체적인 수업 흐름은 블로그에 있습니다.</p></a><p><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostList.nhn?blogId=obafgkim&amp;from=postList&amp;categoryNo=21#\" class=\"se-module se-module-image __se_image_link __se_link\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot; : &quot;SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f&quot;, &quot;src&quot; : &quot;https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAxOTA4MjlfNyAg/MDAxNTY3MDQ1MjEzODc3.4h7yhKSFud9Z2hatXrkmhr7lsK4a0KrdS3__gN1s8RIg.1gEdIS10_1z6FOckilg20GlS9HHFC04JAJBI5Jv4Y3Ag.JPEG.obafgkim/슬라이드1.JPG&quot;, &quot;linkUse&quot; : &quot;false&quot;, &quot;link&quot; : &quot;&quot;}\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: block;\"></a><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/obafgkim/221632111654\">https://blog.naver.com/obafgkim/221632111654</a><br></p><p><br></p><p>같은 학교에 근무하고 계신 선생님들께서 많이 도와주시고</p><p>아이디어 또한 제공해주셔서</p><p>수업에 이것 저것 협동활동을&nbsp;많이 시도하고 있는데요,</p><p>따로 강의에 신경쓰지 않아도</p><p>학생들이 생각보다 영상 시청과 학습지, 상호교수 만으로</p><p>개념습득을 잘 해줘서</p><p>자료 제작에 보람을 느끼고 있습니다!</p><p><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eqYRQGq6Si8\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AzPoS40_tMg\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cBN2iTQ5FhI\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p8FPWqdP1p4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostList.nhn?blogId=obafgkim&amp;from=postList&amp;categoryNo=21#\" class=\"se-module se-module-image __se_image_link __se_link\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot; : &quot;SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f&quot;, &quot;src&quot; : &quot;https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAxOTA4MjlfNyAg/MDAxNTY3MDQ1MjEzODc3.4h7yhKSFud9Z2hatXrkmhr7lsK4a0KrdS3__gN1s8RIg.1gEdIS10_1z6FOckilg20GlS9HHFC04JAJBI5Jv4Y3Ag.JPEG.obafgkim/슬라이드1.JPG&quot;, &quot;linkUse&quot; : &quot;false&quot;, &quot;link&quot; : &quot;&quot;}\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; display: block;\"><br></a><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/PostList.nhn?blogId=obafgkim&amp;from=postList&amp;categoryNo=21#\" class=\"se-module se-module-image __se_image_link __se_link\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot; : &quot;SE-42d2a0d0-b1cc-42e4-b31c-5e0f758ddc7f&quot;, &quot;src&quot; : &quot;https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAxOTA4MjlfNyAg/MDAxNTY3MDQ1MjEzODc3.4h7yhKSFud9Z2hatXrkmhr7lsK4a0KrdS3__gN1s8RIg.1gEdIS10_1z6FOckilg20GlS9HHFC04JAJBI5Jv4Y3Ag.JPEG.obafgkim/슬라이드1.JPG&quot;, &quot;linkUse&quot; : &quot;false&quot;, &quot;link&quot; : &quot;&quot;}\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: basel